sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant App
  participant Auth as Auth server
  participant API
  U->>App: Click "Log in"
  App->>Auth: Redirect to log in
  U->>Auth: Enter password
  Auth-->>App: Authorization code
  App->>Auth: Code + secret
  Auth-->>App: Access token
  App->>API: Request + token
  API-->>App: Data
